The call is over.
The screen is black.
I sit alone in my flat.
It is quiet here now.
But I smile.
My family is far away in Mexico.
But they are close to my heart.
I always have them with me.
I am not alone.
I look out my window.
It is dark outside.
I am tired, but happy.
It is good to be here.
Tomorrow is a new day.
